00:09:06,666 --> 00:09:12,666
Overnight is a documentary film directed by Mark Brian Smith.

3
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:46,000
Alternately hilarious and horrifying, Overnight chronicles one
man's misadventures of making a Hollywood movie.

4
00:18:13,333 --> 00:18:19,333
It starts out as a rags to riches story as Troy Duffy, a Boston-bred
bartender, sells his first screenplay for The Boondock Saints.

5
